{"channelId":"UCZF0_l3KJkt-45DiZ6Ks9VQ","row":["Subjects in Spinal Cord Injury Rehabilitation",null,"This channel serves to provide education material for patients, their families and friends and non-medical laypeople on Spinal cord injuries (SCI), how they can affect functioning in everyday lives and how the use of therapy techniques with your therapist or at home can be implemented to improve participation in everyday activities.  Subjects will range from ADLs (activities such as activities as feeding, grooming and dressing) transfers from different surfaces and upper extremity management after a SCI; which all can become more difficult after a SCI.\nThese videos are for educational purposes only, and one should consult their medical doctor and/or rehabilitation specialist (physical or occupational therapist prior to implementing anything seen in theses videos.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZF0_l3KJkt-45DiZ6Ks9VQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZF0_l3KJkt-45DiZ6Ks9VQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:10.741Z","channelId":"UCZF0_l3KJkt-45DiZ6Ks9VQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a3e56ac4a1717024c57ef5959e68fdda18fd7e4504578c7681c0ebd2236f372d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"76ae947e192a0a5d36f55e3b992b6b3099c8454509f54500aeedabc898034800"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"e from ADLs (activities such as activities as feeding, grooming and dressing) transfers from different surfaces and upper extremity management after a SCI; which all can become more dif